<aside class="ballot-privacy-note" aria-label="How your vote is recorded">
  <p>
    <strong>Your vote is identifiable to national administrators.</strong>
    Aggregate totals are public; in a very small ballot they may effectively reveal how a small
    number of members voted. See the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for how votes and
    reasons are handled.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .ballot-privacy-note {
    padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--horizon-line);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--horizon-purple);
    border-radius: 0.45rem;
    background: var(--horizon-lavender-soft);
    color: var(--horizon-muted);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ballot-privacy-note p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ballot-privacy-note strong {
    color: var(--horizon-purple-deep);
  }

  .ballot-privacy-note a {
    color: var(--horizon-purple-deep);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration-color: var(--horizon-accent);
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
  }
</style>
